Chapter: MobileMain
  cites MobileApp chapter MobileApp
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 The bootable entry point for the CodexMagic mobile app. It lives in its
 own chapter, apart from the MobileApp library, because every page chapter
 cites MobileApp back for navigation and shared state. An entry chapter
 that its own cites reach is fed to the compiler twice, and the second
 arrival of `opening` is CDX3001. Moving the entry out breaks that.

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    let s1 = state-set sk-page 0
    in let s2 = set-render (render)
    in let s3 = register-handlers (on-pick) (on-click)
    in let s4 = check-session 0
    in let r = render 0
    in print-line "CodexMagic Mobile initialized"
  end
